        "description": "<p>Awsome Team Card is a custom  addon plugin that adds extra widgets such as sliders, social icons, and custom UI elements to enhance website design flexibility.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code></li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the WordPress Plugins screen</li>\n<li>Go to Elementor editor and use the new widgets</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20require%20elementor%3F\">\nDoes it require Elementor?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, this plugin requires Elementor to function.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"is%20it%20free%3F\">\nIs it free?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it is fully free and GPL licensed.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
